00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:51.050
it's always so fun
to see you jump into a role.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.351
I think you're a great actor.

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:55.388
And "Palmer," it's, uh --
you play --

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.789
your character's Eddie Palmer,

00:00:56.789 --> 00:00:58.858
who is a high school
