00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:03.663
who has -- his life takes
an unfortunate turn, and --

00:01:03.663 --> 00:01:05.765
But, dude,
you nailed this character.

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.166
Can you talk about the character

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.501
and set up the movie
